CT,25,T
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F118A1788464144
OL,1,  V<,,4<,,4<,,4Spp0pp0p``0pp0     G10/19
OL,2,T]V5b(55b(55j5Sj5.%jj5/l4
OL,3,  V-,,%-,,%-,,%S#"!##!###!##!
OL,5, Police have stepped up their search for
OL,6, a nightwatchman thought to have been
OL,7, abducted after disturbing burglars.
OL,9,FPolice said Mr John Cook, 40, made a
OL,10,Fphone call to a relative last night but
OL,11,Fseemed very confused during the call.
OL,13,FThe alarm was raised yesterday when Mr
OL,14,FCook was found to have disappeared from
OL,15,Fhis post at a club in Llansamlet near
OL,16,FSwansea. There were signs of a struggle
OL,17,Fat the club.
OL,19,FDetectives are working on the theory Mr
OL,20,FCook has been abducted. They said they
OL,21,Fwere very concerned for his safety.
OL,22,F
OL,23,T]CFrom 03-09-89   teletextarchive.com
